4,2000,70,109,23]],"links":[["Ontonagon County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/michigan/ontonagon-county"],["ARC or PLC in Ontonagon County","/arc-plc/michigan/ontonagon-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, April to May and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids. In 2025, April to May ran 78% of normal on the middle of the grids, and so far in 2026 May to June sits at 66%. Grid 31663 had its driest year in 1976 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
